        are available and the current connection state.
    -->
    <string name="gesture_pad_description">VisionAid gesture pad. Current status: %1$s. Double-tap anywhere to activate voice command. Long press anywhere to describe scene. Two-finger swipe up or down to adjust volume.</string>

